SY_TALK("fUlVB19xEhI",[[61,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[71,["Yesterday we talked about"]],[78,["the power that lies within us which is the power of the Holy Ghost"]],[86,["and which has to give us the Self-realization."]],[92,["Now, one may say that we have never heard about such a thing,"]],[97,["it's a very new idea but this is the knowledge of the roots."]],[107,["In the West we have the knowledge of the tree"]],[112,["and somebody must also have the knowledge of the roots - there's nothing objectionable about it."]],[121,["Like in the East people learnt about Science and other knowledge"]],[128,["that the Western people gathered, in the same way, when this tree of life grew so big"]],[137,["there was a search inside as well and when that search started, they in their meditative"]],[144,["processes, they found out that within us lies the power which can give us Self-realization."]],[152,["But this very, very ancient discovery - this is nothing new that I'm telling you."]],[159,["Only thing is that today the time has come, the blossom time has come,"]],[164,["that many can get Self-realization."]],[169,["But Self-realization history is very, very ancient"]],[174,["that it is said that about 16000 years back"]],[180,["the king of all the Gods, called Indra, got his realization. I don't know in Greeks,"]],[186,["Greek language what He is called as but He is the one, who got his realization in a place called Chidendra"]],[194,["means, He was made, the hole was made into His head - Chidendra."]],[200,["So this knowledge existed in our country since centuries because people had"]],[208,["more meditative temperament. Now this meditative temperament comes because they did not have to fight the Nature so much."]],[216,["As you know, the climate in India is quite good, people can go outside"]],[222,["there's no problem of too much heat or uh.. too much uh.. wind -"]],[228,["it is easy to live outside and that's how people didn't fight much of the Nature."]],[235,["Because of the fighting with the Nature, the reaction created this"]],[242,["enthusiasm of the Western people to find out something about the Nature"]],[247,["and that's how we discovered all the Science and all the discoveries which we are enjoying but"]],[256,["whatever we have discovered so far, is a part of the same."]],[262,["If you do not discover say, all these instruments, you cannot today talk to people,"]],[268,["you cannot propagate what is important, you cannot achieve"]],[275,["the Spiritual ascent en-masse, you cannot give it to thousands of people unless and until you have some means to do it."]],[284,["So, even these discoveries are just complementary to the discoveries about the Self."]],[292,["The Kundalini has been described by many people"]],[299,["but specially, I would mention, Markandeya who lived about 14000 years back."]],[305,["He described this Kundalini, about which I told you yesterday, which resides in the triangular bone"]],[311,["and I told you that even the Greeks called it a Sacrum bone, meaning a sacred bone."]],[316,["Now the word sacredness, holiness - all these are becoming sort of out of date"]],[323,["but there's a fact, there is something that is Holy, something that is Sacred."]],[328,["Now what is this sacredness is, what is this Holiness is, it is rather difficult"]],[335,["for us to know because we deal with matter and matter doesn't talk about these things. At the most, if you go on"]],[343,["with the matter, you go on analysing it one after another and we reach analysis of everything disintegrating"]],[351,["the other parts. Like Medical Science now few"]],[356,["start studying the human body through Medical Science, which I also studied."]],[361,["You go on analysing it. Ultimately, you reach a point uh.. where you will find a doctor -"]],[369,["one doctor for one eye another doctor for another eye - there's no synthesis but"]],[375,["when you go to the roots, it is the synthesis of all the uh.. nature, of all the characters of a trade."]],[382,["So this is the difference between the approach of one to another."]],[388,["Now this knowledge was not written down"]],[393,["was told to people, communicated to very few people and that's how it was passed on"]],[401,["from people to people. In the earlier days, they tried only on one or two persons whether they could get realization."]],[409,["At the time of Rama, his father-in-law was the person who was quite deft uh.. in"]],[416,["giving realization but he gave realization to one person called Nachiketa. So you can imagine"]],[423,["that how difficult it was to give realization to one person. First they had to cleanse a person, then"]],[431,["tell him to lead a very austere life, a life of balance - all kinds of things were done and then the Kundalini was"]],[438,["made to rise. That too one by one, every center it used to rise"]],[444,["and then they would see that it was established. For that they had to lead a very secluded life"]],[451,["and it was worked out when the children were about, say, twelve years of age"]],[458,["to about twenty-five years, in complete celibate life."]],[463,["But now, as the time has come, as I told you, that blossom time has come."]],[469,["But one must know that those who are sitting here, have gone through it - it is not a new thing that you have come here,"]],[476,["you're already ready for it and that's how you are going to get it. Only in this life time,"]],[482,["in these modern times, we have committed some mistakes because we were cut off from this,"]],[488,["cut off from the knowledge of the roots and suddenly we became modern"]],[494,["and in this modernism, we started understanding everything through our mental projections."]],[500,["Now mental projection can be very mythical. Supposing, I project My mind"]],[505,["and I say that, ' I am just now sitting in New York, I'm feeling like this and that,' - it's just a mental projection."]],[512,["Whatever we do has to be real but mostly mental projections are mythical"]],[518,["and many people have done that and have been successful in life, so called, they have made lots of money,"]],[525,["they have put their mental projections to this, mental projections to that and said, \"This is knowledge, this is knowledge, this is knowledge.\""]],[531,["And how are we to make out whether this is true or not? Is there any Absolute method"]],[538,["by which we can make out whether this is true or not?"]],[542,["The reason is, the Absolute is nowhere to be seen, it's the relative life in which we live."]],[551,["Now the words like Holiness or the words like Sacredness and Auspiciousness,"]],[557,["have lost their value because we have lost the sense of that knowledge, that sensitivity."]],[564,["As I told you yesterday that I went to Rome and the mayor there just seeing My photograph, just"]],[571,["said, \"Oh, this is Divinity!\" and he helped us so much but the thing that has acted in him, is that sensitive"]],[579,["temperament which he, they have retained somehow or the other or it existed within him."]],[585,["But we have to understand that every matter has a kind of a"]],[594,["coefficience by which it can tell you whether it is sacred or not, which is Holy or not."]],[603,["Like in India, we say that this place is Holy. Now how do we say this is a Holy place,"]],[611,["how do we understand this is a Holy place? Because a person who is a realized soul, who"]],[617,["may not be a rich man, he may be a poor man, he might be just a ascetic, he may be a married man but a realized soul"]],[625,["is a category, is a state of mind, if he has, he can feel the"]],[631,["Divine vibrations from that place and can say, \"O, this is a Holy place.\" I'll give you an instance."]],[638,["In Rahuri is a place uh.. uh.. called as Musalwadi and that place they have got a huge, big lake"]],[647,["and that lake was uh.. to be"]],[651,["put into proper channel so they thought, make a big [UNCLEAR - BUNK OR BUND?]  on it."]],[656,["So they tried to make - an Englishman. It is about 50 - 60 years back an English engineer tried to make a bund there"]],[662,["and at a point he found he could not build anything. The thing that he build used to fall down,"]],[669,["again he used to build something, used to fall down; So he was surprised. Then one"]],[675,["Muslim fakir, as we call them - a realized soul came that way, he said, \"Oh, this you leave it, this is a Holy place,"]],[682,["you cannot do anything, you better leave it alone.\" So they went round that place."]],[687,["Can you imagine a bund going uh.. straight like this and the place is like that!"]],[692,["So when I went to that place they asked Me, \"Mother, we would like You to see if it is a Holy place.\""]],[698,["I took some of the sahaja yogies who are sitting here and when we went there"]],[704,["we found it was emitting cool breeze from that place. You could feel it, all of us could feel it."]],[709,["Now, it is something, a miracle for people to think that how this can give cool breeze."]],[716,["Now as you know that the Spiritual touch of anything"]],[725,["starts emitting vibrations. There's another example I'll give you when"]],[732,["I went to Kashmir once and we were driving along a road"]],[737,["and I just felt tremendous vibrations coming from somewhere so I asked the driver, I said,"]],[742,["\"Is there a temple here or something?\" He said, \"No, it's all wilderness. I said, \"Alright,"]],[748,["uh.. let's go the way the vibrations are coming.\" So we went to a place of complete wilderness and passed through that and"]],[756,["then we saw some poor people living there, some Muslims so I asked them, \"Is there any temple here?\" They said, \"No, we don't have"]],[764,["but we have a mosque ahead.\" I said, \"What mosque is that?\" They said, \"This is Hazratbal.\""]],[770,["I said, \"Hazratbal?\" They said, \"There's one hair of Mohammad Sahab kept there.\""]],[775,["I caught it about five, seven miles away from there so we went and we saw. I saw it was there"]],[782,["because it was emitting vibrations - of course we couldn't see the hair because hair was kept inside."]],[788,["Now this is the thing we have been told even in the Bible"]],[792,["that whatever is created by Mother Earth or by the sky, is not to be reproduced and worshipped."]],[799,["Now we must think what is created by the Mother Earth? We never think on those lines,"]],[804,["we just accept whatever people give us the interpretation but let us think what is created by the Mother Earth."]],[810,["This is what are the Holy places created by Mother Earth. Say, for example, Stonehenge that you have here."]],[817,["Perhaps you do not know it's a Holy thing. All these stones have come out of the Mother Earth,"]],[822,["then some stupid people must have taken it out [UNCLEAR - HUNED?] it up put these things but"]],[827,["actually the stones that have come out, are really the stones that have come out of the Mother Earth."]],[832,["If you go there and see, it has vibrations. Not only that but it is made in the way, same way as this Kundalini is."]],[839,["So you had, on this island, some people who knew the knowledge of the Divine."]],[846,["They definitely knew otherwise how is it they went round and made a circular thing like that"]],[852,["and they even now go, these tourists go and worship them but they don't know what they're doing, they have no idea what they are doing."]],[859,["As I told you yesterday, like Mohammad Sahab has told you how to do namaz but the Muslims don't know why to do namaz,"]],[866,["what does that mean, what all these things mean, what Allah-ho-Akbar means - they just do it because they're told."]],[872,["So there's a gap between what we're told and the gap between what it is but there is a coefficience"]],[880,["of Divinity in a thing. Unless and until you become the Spirit, you cannot feel it."]],[886,["Like the magnet can feel the magnetism, in the same way, you have to become that which can feel all those"]],[894,["beautiful things which we call as the Divine vibrations. Now, the Divine vibration flows within us"]],[902,["when we get our Self-realization. Before that we are cut off from our Spirit."]],[909,["The Spirit resides in our heart and we are, our attention is not enlightened by that Spirit."]],[917,["The Spirit watches us like a witness, it watches us,"]],[922,["sees how we behave, where we go, what we do, everything is just watching - it's a spectator. That's the situation is of God also,"]],[930,["God Almighty is watching the play, is watching the play of His power which we call as the Holy Ghost."]],[938,["Holy Ghost is the power or we can say, is the Mother who, who has created the whole world,"]],[945,["who has created the whole Universe and is showing the play to one spectator that is the God Almighty"]],[952,["and He is watching all that play and when He's watching all that play, He wants to enjoy it -"]],[959,["the moment He doesn't like it He can destroy it. In the same way within ourselves resides"]],[966,["this Spirit which watches us and sees what we are up to, what we do. But the Kundalini,"]],[973,["this one, which is the Holy Ghost, the reflection of the Holy Ghost which resides in the triangular bone, records everything that we do."]],[980,["It's just like a tape-recorder. It records what we do, what have been our hankering, where have we been, what we have been doing."]],[987,["It's a subtler knowledge; For that we have to extend ourselves and understand that at the human level"]],[994,["you can only go into four dimensions at the most but the fourth one is also in the thinking."]],[1001,["Three dimensions actually exist for you but the fourth dimension is in your thinking -"]],[1008,["you have imagined, you have listened to people, you have been told by people, it has been"]],[1015,["uh..described to you but it is not part and parcel of your being - is just you know as there -"]],[1021,["it's something else, is not yourself. Now this fourth dimension you have to achieve."]],[1027,["So to know this fourth dimension there has to be some arrangement within us, if we are created for that."]],[1035,["If we have to become the fourth dimension, there must be some arrangement within us and this is the arrangement we have got of"]],[1042,["uh.. our subtle being which remains working"]],[1048,["as Parasympathetic Nervous System. Now this Parasympathetic Nervous System is a system within us"]],[1055,["which nourishes us, gives us balance, repairs us just like a fountain"]],[1064,["of every energy but that too has limited energy. Sympathetic Nervous System we use"]],[1071,["when we have any emergencies - as we run fast uh.. we develop a very high speed"]],[1078,["and the heart can start pumping very fast but when we relax,"]],[1085,["heart comes back to it's own position. That happens through the Parasympathetic Nervous System."]],[1091,["Parasympathetic Nervous System also repairs us all the time but it has a limited energy"]],[1099,["and that's how diseases are caused because we exhaust our limited energies due to some reason."]],[1106,["May be, it may be that we have overused it so much that it is not"]],[1113,["to be now fulfilled by the Parasympathetic. All these things happen and we develop diseases of different kinds."]],[1120,["As I told you yesterday we have three powers within us. One of them is the left-hand side power of desire,"]],[1128,["the second power is the right-hand side power of action and the central power of our evolution."]],[1136,["So the left-hand side power is manifested outside in the gross as Left Sympathetic Nervous System"]],[1144,["and the right-hand side is manifested within us as the Right Sympathetic Nervous System"]],[1150,["and the central one, the Parasympathetic - so in the gross we call them by these names."]],[1157,["Now, the evolutionary process has taken place since long - it's not today that the evolution has been going on."]],[1164,["At the matter level the evolution takes place when we have the periodic table"]],[1170,["and the Carbon is placed in the center and balancing, it has four valencies, then it becomes higher and higher and higher."]],[1178,["At the human stage when we come, we start balancing ourselves like trial and error. First we try this,"]],[1185,["\"Oh, it's no good, it doesn't help us,\" so try another. It's like we try"]],[1189,["uh.. Capitalism, then Communism, then Capitalism, then Communism - we try all these things."]],[1194,["It's just we go from one extreme to another extreme, then we try to come to the center"]],[1201,["and when we come to the center, that's the time our ascent takes place - it's not going to the left or to the right."]],[1209,["Now the left represents our past and the right represents our future so we have to be in the present, at this moment"]],[1217,["we have to be there but we cannot be. We can, now for example people might be thinking at this time about the past,"]],[1225,["may be about the future, \"Whether I'll get the conveyance or not,\" but at this moment"]],[1232,["we cannot stay but when we come to this moment, there is no thought, there is no thought."]],[1238,["One thought rises and falls off, another thought rises and falls off. In between the thought there's a little gap"]],[1244,["and that gap is the present and that we cannot feel within ourselves because we live in the past or in the future."]],[1253,["So when this Kundalini rises, what She does, She elongates those thoughts and by that elongation"]],[1261,["the gap between the two thoughts elongates, we can say, increases"]],[1267,["and we become thoughtlessly aware. But in the movement of the Kundalini,"]],[1274,["when  the Kundalini moves, from this state when it rises"]],[1279,["first it enters, as you see, into the first chakra of the"]],[1286,["this green chakra, which we can as the Nabhi Chakra."]],[1291,["The Nabhi chakra is the one, which we can, the Navel center or the Solar Plexus, in the, in the gross is called as Solar Plexus"]],[1299,["which has got ten sub-plexuses, in the same way, this has got ten petals, is said there are ten petals."]],[1306,["Now this is a very important center for us because this is the center where we start our evolution."]],[1314,["As animals we were seeking food, we were seeking protection and that's how we evolved."]],[1320,["Then, now at a human stage this seeking is"]],[1325,["manifested as we seek power - people want to become members of Parliament, this, that is all seeking in the power."]],[1332,["Then some people want to have money, possessions, this, that - we seek in possessions."]],[1338,["Some people think that, \"This is my son, my child,\" - this my, my business goes on"]],[1343,["and they call it love and it's very possessiveness also sometimes and that's also manifests but then they discover"]],[1352,["that these things do not give you joy - there's something beyond that must be giving us joy"]],[1359,["and when that comes within our awareness then our real evolution starts."]],[1366,["That's the point one has to reach. That's a special category of people whom we call as seekers but at this point"]],[1374,["it's a very dangerous thing. I've warned you before also, two years back, I told you that there are people in the market"]],[1383,["who are just waiting to catch hold of you because they're all here to just make money, nothing else - it's all money-oriented."]],[1391,["And when you are seeking they just grab you. They tell you, \"Alright, five pounds for this and you get God.\""]],[1399,["Can you imagine such nonsense they talk and people believe them!"]],[1404,["How can you get your evolution by giving money, think of it!"]],[1410,["And when I told this they were so angry with Me. I said you cannot do it, you cannot organize it, it's natural process, is your birthright"]],[1418,["to get your realization and nobody can charge you money - it's a ridiculous."]],[1425,["You are very intelligent people, you have got sciences and all that but in these matters you don't know anything, you are naive"]],[1432,["to accept these things as that you can pay for God, you can uh.. pay for your evolution, you can pay for your realization."]],[1442,["The same thing here happens to you when you start seeking, then you think we must do something about, we must put in some effort."]],[1451,["As I told you yesterday, with effort you go in the wrong direction - either you move to the left side or to the right side."]],[1459,["So when you move to the left side, what happens you get possessed,"]],[1464,["you get possessed because on the left side all your Collective Consciousness is there."]],[1470,["Cancer is caused by possessions - that is the one that triggers. I saw a television show in which"]],[1477,["they told Me, the doctors uh.. were telling people that"]],[1485,["the vulnerability of the cancer is first established because when sympathetic is too much active,"]],[1492,["vulnerable you become but triggering takes place with some proteins called protein 58"]],[1499,["and protein 52 - because they give just names - uh.. they attack you and the triggering comes from"]],[1508,["the area which is built within us since our creation - means the Collective Subconscious."]],[1515,["So unless and until you get possessed by something cancer cannot be triggered though we are vulnerable every moment"]],[1522,["because we are so much on the sympathetic - all the time we are in emergency. So this kind of an attack comes to us from"]],[1530,["this area which is built within us, known as Collective Consciousness, Subconscious."]],[1535,["Now this Collective Subconscious is existing within us since our creation."]],[1542,["Now, if you start moving too much into, say, bow to someone and submit to someone"]],[1549,["and that guru is an expert on all these things, which we call in Sanskrit language,"]],[1554,["as Preta Vidya, Shamshan Vidya - is the, uh..is the knowledge of the dead -"]],[1560,["then they can entice you, they can mesmerise you, they can ask you to kill yourself, they can do what they like, they'll say, \"Go and destroy yourself.\""]],[1568,["You have heard of such cases where people have destroyed."]],[1572,["But we must use our intelligence to understand that, \"Are we to destroy ourselves now?\""]],[1580,["Then they are another kind, they will say, \"You have to jump like frogs, you have to jump all the time.\""]],[1587,["Anybody can jump; What is so great? But are we to become frogs or worms?"]],[1595,["Then some people going to these things, I mean, TM now, I must tell you openly, I have so many people coming from TM,  suffering from Epilepsy -"]],[1603,["absolutely they suffer from Epilepsy, no doubt about it and they have come to Me and the person who was the"]],[1609,["director of their uh... academic in"]],[1615,["[ASIDE - WHAT WAS THAT PLACE?] [ROANOKE OR RONOCK?]  [ROANOKE OR RONOCK?]  in, in Scotland"]],[1620,["he came to Me and he was suffering from Epilepsy, his wife was suffering from Epilepsy, his child was suffering from Epilepsy."]],[1627,["The fellow was such a rich man, he was a diamond merchant, he became a bankrupt, he had to go away to South Africa,"]],[1634,["the wife is now gone to India, she's so fed up of life. Now of course, she's cured with sahaja yoga and the child is alright."]],[1641,["So they paid thousands of pounds, thousands - six thousand pounds they paid to this man,"]],[1648,["to go to Switzerland where they were given food for six days, in such way, that first day only the water"]],[1655,["that has boiled some potatoes. Then the second day that same water, third day the same water, fourth day the same water"]],[1663,["and the fifth day they were given the rind of the potato with all the filth - imagine what a mockery!"]],[1669,["And last day, the potato and six thousand pounds they paid each - is a fact."]],[1675,["There are so many sitting here, from TM, who have been cured. Now people go just headlong, why?  Because they wanted to fly."]],[1684,["Who has flown? Put their guru on to one of these uh.. Pisa, what you call, the leaning tower of Pisa."]],[1691,["Let him fly, let's see, can he fly? He cannot fly but when I tell about them people don't like it because I'm telling you the truth"]],[1699,["that understand, you cannot pay for it. Now why you want to fly, I can't understand - are you going to become birds?"]],[1707,["All these queer and strange ideas, how can any intelligent man go to but the reason I ask them sometimes"]],[1715,["why, why did you? There's a Jew girl, very intelligent, she's very well educated and a barrister and all that"]],[1722,["she had big problems. I asked her, \"Why, why did you go to TM? What was so great? This was all stupid they did, then why did you go?\""]],[1731,["She said, \"I was so fed up with the fanaticism of the Jews that I jumped into it.\""]],[1736,["Another one says, \"I was so fed up with the Catholics that I went there.\" Another says, \"The Christians were so this way, I went there.\""]],[1745,["This is going 'from fire to frying pan.'"]],[1749,["How the brain works I don't understand but it is so"]],[1755,["much a common sense to understand, if somebody says that, by saying some words you are going to fly in the air"]],[1763,["for that you have to pay some money and you accept it, I must say, that somebody has really enticed you and mesmerised you"]],[1771,["otherwise nobody who is saying would accept such an absurd thing - isn't it?"]],[1776,["And I was shocked because these are the seekers, again I say, the special category of people who are seeking God."]],[1785,["Then another group comes from India, another thugs, I tell you, real thugs, you must know"]],[1792,["that Indians are now trying to attack you in a subtle way, definitely because you attacked them in a very gross way so now they are attacking you."]],[1800,["Same thing happening in America - you go and destroyed them, they're not dead, they're there - they are attacking back Americans."]],[1807,["And that's how you are attacked and you accept these things because, you see, they pamper your ego,"]],[1814,["perhaps because they tell you something very intellectual, big things and you accept."]],[1818,["Why don't you go and find out what's happening to the people? How many people have gone to the lunatic asylum?"]],[1824,["And they have money, they have so much money they can hush up anything. There were one fellow who ran away from India"]],[1832,["to America because he, Indians couldn't bear him"]],[1837,["and this fellow who ran away to America, you see, a picture was made about them, what was that, it's"]],[1844,["'God who ran away' or something like that, that picture was shown here in the BBC."]],[1851,["BBC showed it, we have got the tape of that but this fellow has so much money that he purchased that picture from BBC"]],[1860,["and now it cannot be shown to the public; I wish we could show you that but in the private, in the drawing-rooms you can see."]],[1868,["All these tricks are there, you see, so the money itself begets money,"]],[1875,["also begets all kinds of trickeries. You gave him money, you gave them money and they are playing money on you."]],[1883,["One must understand that as far as God is concerned, keep money away."]],[1888,["Anybody who asks for money is seeking money - how can he talk of God?"]],[1897,["This seeking can take you to the right side also, like these lamas are -"]],[1902,["all these people are doing right side jobs, what you call the Supra-conscious jobs, the Collective Supra-conscious."]],[1909,["Lamas, you see, you must have known that Hitler took advice from lamas."]],[1914,["Lamas gave them advice how to capture these spirits who are very aggressive, very ruthless, very"]],[1921,["uh.. very heartless people, emotionless and that's how he managed"]],[1926,["to entice these Germans, who are still there."]],[1930,["Even in this country or everywhere you can find this horrible, aggressive uh.. spirits are hovering on people"]],[1937,["who try to destroy others. So that work is still on,"]],[1942,["that play is still on. Actually, I must say, in the West people have, are so naive - they have no idea about the dead."]],[1951,["What happens about the dead, they don't know and they play about. For example to have all the dead bodies in the church, is very dangerous for children."]],[1962,["Special care must be taken when you take your children to the cemetery -"]],[1967,["it's very dangerous. I mean, Indian churches don't have anything like that. No Indian would tolerate a nonsense like that to have"]],[1974,["to walk on the graves - imagine! A lady came here to see the cathedral, they took her round,"]],[1980,["she's walking like this. I said, \"Why?\" She said, \"You see, all dead are lying here, how to walk on top of them?\""]],[1985,["We have no idea as to how this dead acts and all these diseases are so common in this country"]],[1994,["or in the West, are because we have not paid any attention to keep out the dead."]],[2001,["Now this knowledge was not with you that's why they took advantage of you, they came down here upon you and enticed you."]],[2010,["And this enticement is so subtle that you can make it out. Then, in India we grow all kinds of drugs,"]],[2018,["all kinds of drugs. I've never seen any drug all My life nor do I know one person who is an Indian who takes drugs - can you imagine?"]],[2026,["But here, the drugs have crawled into - how? Because these people have introduced and the dead -"]],[2033,["those dead who want drugs, want you to drink."]],[2037,["Even Alcoholism, if you go maximum to that side, can take you to that kind of enticement."]],[2044,["Alcoholism can be cured by sahaja yoga because is a spirit that is drinking. It's not that you are drinking."]],[2051,["Like, I had a lady from Cuba, a thin, little, petite lady and her husband told Me,"]],[2057,["\"She can take one bottle of whisky neat.\" I said, \"Annh, she looks such a little thing how can she take one bottle?\" \"Yes, she does.\""]],[2065,["So I asked her, I put a, a bandhan, as we call it, on her"]],[2070,["and I saw a huge, big negro coming out of her. I asked her, \"Did you know any negro?\""]],[2077,["She said, \"Mother, did you see him, you see him! This is the one who drinks - everyone blames me.\""]],[2086,["Really, she said so and now she is a cured woman."]],[2091,["So, all these extremes things if you go - if you go to the extreme of the right - now people are jogging like mad. I mean,"]],[2097,["one should not do anything of extremes - little bit is alright,"]],[2101,["but going like mad, everybody running fast like, you'll get heart attacks, you must understand. You'll get heart attacks in no time."]],[2108,["Wearing tight clothes to that extent - you will get varicose veins, you will develop all these uh.."]],[2115,["troubles of your uh.. knees and all that. You must understand you should be normal people, you should"]],[2121,["keep yourself in a way that you do everything in a moderate manner, so you keep in the central path of evolution."]],[2129,["But going to the extreme of everything is our style."]],[2134,["We go to extremes as Indians also go to some extremes and you go to another extremes, we can see the uh.."]],[2140,["uh..French going to another extremes - everybody is like that; They are towards the extremes but keep a moderate life"]],[2148,["and the one who leads a moderate life, is very easy for him to get his ascent."]],[2154,["Now the same seeking becomes the seeking of God, seeking of beyond, seeking of something higher"]],[2161,["and that higher, is the Spirit; You have to become the Spirit"]],[2167,["and when you become the Spirit, what happens to you that we have to see."]],[2172,["When you become the Spirit, physically you get alright automatically."]],[2180,["When you start getting the vibrations, physically you are alright. Leukemia can be cured, cancer can be cured, so many things can be cured -"]],[2188,["Why? Because the exhausted energy that is in your centers gets refilled,"]],[2197,["you get connected from here to the whole, to the subtler energy which is nourishing, which is permeated into everything,"]],[2205,["which is nourishing everything - you get in contact with that; This is the yoga"]],[2210,["and all the time that energy is flowing within you. When it is flowing within you, you do not get into tensions."]],[2219,["Not only that but this connection makes you an universal being."]],[2224,["You become part and parcel of the whole - you are already but you are not aware."]],[2229,["For this finger is aware that it is a part and parcel of the whole but we are not aware that we are part and parcel of the whole."]],[2237,["So what happens that we feel, \"Oh, we have helped this gentleman, we have helped that gentleman, we have done so much for that person.\""]],[2246,["Actually whom do you help? You help yourself. If this finger is sick and if this finger rubs it,"]],[2253,["is it helping anyone? In the same way in sahaja yoga, we are not helping anyone, we are helping ourselves"]],[2261,["because it just flows to that area which requires help. That's how, but you become collectively conscious"]],[2268,["you start feeling where you are lacking that vitality,"]],[2274,["in what center you lack it, on your finger-tips. As I told you, that English language has a beautiful sentence called finger-tips"]],[2282,["so on your finger-tips you can feel it what is lacking in another person. Then the compassion flows - you become the compassion."]],[2290,["You don't have to say, \"Oh, I'm so compassionate,\" but you are the compassion but it is the compassion"]],[2297,["that starts flowing and when it starts flowing, you're in joy. You don't say, \"I do it.\" You say, \"It goes, it comes.\""]],[2304,["You start talking in a third person. The word 'I' goes away. 'I believe' doesn't exist. Then we say, 'We believe,'"]],[2312,["because we are not alone, we are so many. How can we say 'I', who is the 'I'? 'I' is lost in 'We'."]],[2320,["The energy flows to another person without any difficulty but inside yourself the peace, the joy that you feel."]],[2329,["The attention is so enlightened that you pay attention to anyone and the person feels alright."]],[2336,["You think of anyone you want to know, just put your hands; Like we have someone here from Scotland - he was one of the first few who got realization"]],[2344,["and very great intellectual, so he started doubting. He thought, \"How can it be sitting down here I can feel something?\""]],[2351,["I said, \"Alright, what do you want to know about?\" He said, \"My father has not telephoned for sometime, I would like to know.\" I said, \"Alright, you put your hands like this and try to find out"]],[2359,["how is your father?\" You know very gross level it is, so he put his hand and said, \"Mother, I am getting a burning here, what does that mean?\""]],[2367,["Said, \"It means that your father has a, a very bad uh.. throat trouble.\""]],[2374,["He said, \"Really?\" I said, \"Yes, these are all your father's centers and this center is for the throat.\""]],[2380,["So he telephoned. 'Very bad bronchitis,' this is the word I used and he telephoned to his house and his mother answered"]],[2388,["and he said, \"Where is father?\" He said, \"He is down with very bad bronchitis.\""]],[2393,["He was amazed - I said, \"Alright, we'll cure him now.\" We just rubbed this finger quite a lot"]],[2398,["and there it was, the phone came after one hour, \"Your father is alright, surprisingly, miraculously, I don't know how he got well.\""]],[2408,["So physically you are alright. Mentally - I have seen many mad people become alright because how you become mad"]],[2415,["is that, there is an imbalance, you went on the left side too much, you were pulled back, you've become alright."]],[2422,["Then emotionally you develop a balance. You see, all the time we say, \"My, my, this is my sister,\""]],[2429,["till we discover that she's a snake in the grass, \"She's my sister, she's my,"]],[2435,["my wife, she is my father,\" all those but then you see them in their real"]],[2442,["way. For example, maybe your own sister may be a snake in the grass and"]],[2447,["maybe your husband may be a gem of a person but how do you know?"]],[2452,["How do you know that this person is like that or that? On your vibrations you can see."]],[2460,["Same thing you can ask about these gurus who have come. You ask just a question, \"What do you think of this guru?\" Now anyone -"]],[2468,["if he's a horrible one, you'll get burning over here. Sometimes you get blisters"]],[2475,["on your fingers and you're surprised how you got this blisters"]],[2479,["but the people who are enticed by them are absolutely gone cases."]],[2484,["Till they are absolutely finished they don't come to sahaja yoga."]],[2488,["It's very difficult to convince them that you get out of it, you're enticed because they think"]],[2494,["firstly, they're paid for it so they must go through it - it's a human nature. Supposing you have paid a ticket for a drama or a play"]],[2502,["and you don't like it but still you have paid for it, you sit down, \"Alright, I've paid for it, better go through.\""]],[2507,["Like that, they want to go through it but those who are insane, how can you talk to them?"]],[2514,["The another thing that happens to your attention is that, your attention becomes very balanced."]],[2522,["All the time our eyes are going to this, to that, to  - our eyes become weak and"]],[2528,["we become really confused because every time we see something, we see a reaction comes in. Now I come to this place I see, \"Oh, how many holes,\""]],[2536,["then I start counting the holes and people are really mad I've seen. They see advertisement, they'll say this advertisement, that adver... if they miss one they'll turn around say, \"Oh, I miss that.\""]],[2545,["It's like that. It's a craze with our attention which goes out all the time like mad and it reacts back"]],[2551,["and when it reacts, what happens to us that we become a confusion,"]],[2558,["a complicated personality and we do not know what to see, what not to see."]],[2565,["Now when your attention is enlightened, you just become a pure personality - your eyes become pure."]],[2573,["You just see purity, you can't see impure things. If you see something impure, you feel horrible, don't want to do it."]],[2580,["Like our awareness gets that purity. For example, if you take a dog through a dirty lane,"]],[2588,["he'll just walk through, he'll have no problem but human beings will have to close their nose - they may not even go through that."]],[2594,["But after realization you know what is sin what is not sin and you can walk through the places which are beautiful"]],[2603,["but if it is a sinful place, you don't like it, you don't enjoy - priorities change immediately. You become such a virtuous person,"]],[2611,["you are surprised at yourself what has happened to me. I have known people who have been, so called, uh.."]],[2618,["all kinds of things they call it I don't know what names but all sorts of perverted people, I can say, in general"]],[2625,["uh.. they, if they come to sahaja yoga, they become such beautiful husband, such nice wives,"]],[2631,["such straightforward people, enjoy their married life, enjoy their children and enjoy each other with purity."]],[2639,["Now our society here in the West - for Me it is now My society because I'm sitting here -"]],[2644,["Indian society has it's problems, you have your problems but the society has become so funny that we say that"]],[2653,["uh... if you have an Indian in your house, maybe your things might disappear but if you have an Englishman or a Western man in your house, maybe your wife may disappear -"]],[2662,["is a dangerous thing and nobody minds it - it's love you see; Any nonsense is love."]],[2669,["You spoil anybody's daughter, anything - it's love. All wrong ideas, you see."]],[2675,["If there's purity, say, everybody is a sister or a brother or a mother - a pure relationship -"]],[2683,["the life becomes so much easier. You don't know, sahaja yogies are like that; They travel thousands."]],[2689,["This time they went to Switzerland we had one program there, a seminar, they all lived together, no problem"]],[2696,["otherwise if so many people live there, half of the marriages would have been broken down and so many would have eloped"]],[2703,["and come back again to say that we have divorced again."]],[2707,["This madness of divorce has come because our, our ideas have"]],[2714,["confused us - we're confused. There is no purity."]],[2720,["If a pure person like that even looks at such a person, he becomes pure."]],[2725,["Like Marie Magdalene when she was blessed was Christ, she became a pure woman."]],[2732,["So the purity has to be brought in the society. If you have to save this society, you have to purify"]],[2739,["yourself. Every individual has to purify oneself. Now they say, \"This is freedom,\" - this is license,"]],[2748,["this is not freedom. Freedom is where there is purity. Without purity there is no freedom - is abandonment,"]],[2756,["is nonsense and that's how we have felt about our life. Of course, when I'm saying that, please don't feel guilty"]],[2763,["because that is another thing can happen to you. It's just I'm saying, just telling you how you purify but don't feel guilty about anything"]],[2771,["because whatever I say, you have to forget about it. When I am giving you realization, don't remember all these points otherwise it will be difficult to give you realization."]],[2778,["So that's past, finished, gone case - don't worry on that. Just think that how"]],[2783,["we immediately become part and parcel of a pure, beautiful society."]],[2789,["The race that has been described, the race of God, that what William Blake has described"]],[2794,["that, \"Men of God will become prophets and they'll have powers to make others prophets.\""]],[2801,["For example, for a saint there is nothing like a temptation; He doesn't do wrong things - why?"]],[2808,["He just doesn't do. He doesn't have to tell himself that, \"I don't run away with his things,\" or, \"I don't run away with his wife,\""]],[2814,["or, \"I don't do this wrong,\" or, \"I don't murder anybody.\" He doesn't have to remember that these ten commandments are there - he's just there."]],[2823,["He doesn't have to remember - how? Because he's gone above them. These ten commandments are in these chakras."]],[2831,["In this chakra are these ten commandments that we have to keep a balance - don't do this, don't do that."]],[2837,["That was alright at the time of Moses - if you say these days,\" Don't do,\" you'll have it, so best thing is to raise your Kundalini."]],[2845,["Once you become the Spirit, you become your own master - you start guiding yourself, you know what is wrong, you don't just like it."]],[2851,["I don't have to tell you, you just don't like it - you become a different personality."]],[2858,["Like, I told you, a dog becomes a human being, he doesn't like a dirty lane and when a human become, a human being becomes a saint"]],[2866,["he doesn't like it, he doesn't like. But it doesn't mean that you run away to Himalaya, you run away from here - nothing."]],[2873,["You lead absolutely a normal life but you are a detached person"]],[2878,["and that's how you enjoy the most. For example, see this carpet is beautiful - it's not Mine, I don't possess it. Thank God!"]],[2885,["I can enjoy it better than the person who possesses because he might, the one who possesses it might be thinking, \"Might be dirtied"]],[2891,["don't know, Mother is sitting there, God knows what's going to happen to the carpet. I may have to take it for dry-cleaning,\""]],[2897,["or some sort of a problem will be in his mind but for Me, nothing - I'm just enjoying."]],[2902,["So this idea of possession is a myth, we do not possess anything. It's a myth created by human-beings, you see."]],[2910,["They have a registration office where they put it. This is, belongs to this person but can we carry it with us when we die?"]],[2920,["It's all outside and that's how we understand and then we understand something very, very beautiful about matter"]],[2927,["that the matter is for giving others, matter is to express our feelings to others."]],[2936,["And you become generosity and generosity has it's own blessings."]],[2945,["I enjoy My generosity very much but sometimes, you know, I feel generosity give a problem to Me"]],[2950,["because I open one door to give and ten doors are open to give Me and I don't know where to keep them, you see, it's very difficult."]],[2957,["Now we had a big house, now My husband is saying, \"You better have another big house.\" I said, \"Why?\""]],[2962,["He said, \"These things what to do? Everyday, You see,  You're having from ten doors while You're giving from one door.\" Now if I give from ten doors, there will be twenty doors open."]],[2971,["Generosity fills you completely; You're not at all in need of anything. You try that - open your heart."]],[2979,["You have to open your heart. People don't open their heart, they're so frightened, they'll open a chink and see who's there, \"Oh, I see.\""]],[2987,["It maybe raining, it maybe a snowy day, a lady might be standing with a perambulator and a child will be inside that"]],[2995,["but she'll be afraid to see from a chink. Who's going to invade you, who can destroy you?"]],[3001,["Who can destroy your spirit? Just enjoy your generosity. See how you will have everything."]],[3010,["I'll give you a very small example of this in My own lifetime. I've been like this all My life"]],[3015,["and My husband had problems and My family had problems because of this."]],[3020,["One day I was just sitting outside and knitting something when I saw a lady coming down with two other men"]],[3028,["and she said, \"We are refugees from Punjab, we have no place to live in.\" And I had a huge house because"]],[3033,["My father was Member of the Parliament and he had a huge house of his own so, I said, \"Alright, there's a room here you come along and settle down.\""]],[3041,["Well I didn't ask who they were, what they were doing, I said it's an outside room let them stay there. They stayed."]],[3047,["Then My brother came in - you see, he's now, he's now a minister, you see, a very careful man and My husband came in and My brother"]],[3055,["screwed into his brain that, \"This is wrong, we don't know these may be thieves, these may be this and"]],[3060,["My sister always does like that, I don't know what's going to happen to us and all.\""]],[3065,["I said, \"Whatever they are, they are My responsibility, now you're not going to drive them out at any cost.\""]],[3070,["At that time a war started and people came to kill and one of them was a Muslim so he, the people came"]],[3077,["in our house and they said, \"We have heard there's a Muslim staying in your house.\" I said, \"See this, I am a Christian but I put on this.\""]],[3083,["I said, \"See this is a mark, now, do you believe Me or not.\" I said, \"You better get out from here,\" and they went away and this the fellow was saved, you see."]],[3091,["Now, he was a very great poet. I went to Bombay long, long"]],[3096,["uh.. years later, I should say, about twelve or fourteen years later"]],[3101,["and we were making a little film about something and I was dealing with it so I said, \"I know this lady"]],[3109,["uh.. but I won't come there to ask her because she was a great film actress.\" I said, \"I will not ask her because she'll have no choice.\""]],[3116,["They said, \"But You must say something about.\" I said, \"No, nothing doing, I'm not coming, you go and ask her.\""]],[3121,["So they went and asked her. She said, \"No, no, no, no I cannot join, I must have so much money"]],[3125,["and you cannot have me for nothing at all and this I don't believe in all these charities, this, that,\""]],[3132,["so I kept quiet, didn't say anything but for the opening of the film I went and she was there, she looked at Me and tears started rolling her eyes, just came and embraced Me."]],[3141,["She said, \"I didn't know You were with this.\" I said, \"I know you didn't know, \" but she said, \"Forgive me, I'll give money, I'll give everything."]],[3148,["This is the lady who saved me long time back,\" and everybody was amazed"]],[3154,["how this lady who was so materialistic and so particular about her payment has suddenly melted away."]],[3160,["She said, \"Oh God, now I learnt, I'd forgotten, I'fd forgotten what it means to be generous,\" and she was completely changed after that."]],[3169,["So all these things are the quality of the Spirit which is not afraid of anyone - why should you be afraid of anyone"]],[3177,["if you are one with God? Look at Christ, he had nothing to do with the prostitute but when people started hitting her with the stone"]],[3184,["He came up and He said, \"Now among you, who has not committed any sin, can throw a stone at Me.\""]],[3192,["Imagine the courage! The courage comes from the Spirit. Because He was Spirit, so He could say such a thing."]],[3199,["He was not a man compromising with His values, \"Alright, if you want we can have discotheque in the church,\""]],[3210,["or we can start a pub; Nowadays they are selling it for pubs. \"Let us compromise.\""]],[3218,["Truth cannot compromise - it does not. Compassion is different from compromising."]],[3226,["It cannot compromise - truth stands on it's own legs. So that's what happened when Christ said that"]],[3234,["and that happens to you, you become a strong person. You become a person who's strong"]],[3241,["but does not try to oppress other. You do not try to destroy others, you do not want to hate anyone"]],[3249,["but what you do is, to stand up on your own, to stand up for the rights of other, to stand up for something great."]],[3257,["Like we will say Abraham Lincoln, a person like him - Abraham Lincoln was a realized soul - and how he fought for the rights,"]],[3265,["how he talked about democracy. Today let's compromise this, let's compromise that."]],[3270,["Even if somebody is a Hitler - doesn't matter, as long as he is with us, alright, accept him."]],[3278,["To have that strength you have to be the Spirit - so you become a very, strong, compassionate person."]],[3286,["Only a person who is strong can be compassionate. How can a weakling be a compassionate person - tell Me?"]],[3292,["A tree, which is strong, can only give shelter to people or do you think a falling tree can"]],[3299,["shelter the people - on the contrary it will fall on the people."]],[3303,["Our ideas are very, very confused about compassion"]],[3308,["and when you become such a strong person, you see the truth before you,"]],[3314,["you know the truth and you are no more afraid of anyone and God looks after you, the best part of it."]],[3321,["You just don't worry - God looks after you in every inch of the world."]],[3327,["Every inch of the world - in material way, in your emotional way,"]],[3335,["in your physical way - every way you feel surrounded by His love and His guidance"]],[3343,["and His help. He does in such a way - I'll give you a very recent example of sahaja yogies."]],[3350,["They wanted to go to a place, a very beautiful uh..."]],[3358,["hill, mountain peak, which is known as Zelmet, in uh..."]],[3364,["Switzerland and it's a very expensive place to go to"]],[3368,["because I told them something about that - it looks like a one of the deities and all that - they were wanting to go and have a seminar there."]],[3376,["It's a very expensive place and we cannot pay for that,"]],[3379,["they thought that it will be very difficult because uh.. they are not so well off."]],[3386,["So I said, \"Alright, you go and find out.\" So the people went down to find out and there is a huge, big hotel like place"]],[3394,["and, \"Oh,\" they said, \"When do you want to come?\"  So they said such and such date."]],[3399,["\"Oh, for that date!\" they just ran, \"Oh, very good, very good. If you want to come for those dates - we somehow or the other cannot fill those dates"]],[3406,["so we are very happy.\" And they were charging 70"]],[3413,["francs per night and for three days now they're charging us  - how much - 33 francs, for three days -"]],[3420,["means about eleven pounds or twelve pounds - can you imagine?"]],[3427,["And now all of them can go and see. This is just a miracle and so many miracles take place like that."]],[3433,["Even the poster they have put here - you have seen a big poster uh.. in Brighton - now we can't afford because we don't take any money, we"]],[3441,["whatever little money they have, they collect and put things. They were finding it impossible"]],[3446,["to advertise. We cannot compete with these false people on two things. Firstly, we cannot advertise"]],[3452,["the way they can because they have money and secondly, we cannot go on telling lies the way they do."]],[3457,["They can tell any lies, they'll say that, \"We, we will create a new world for you and there will be all gold for you, \" and all those because they're liars."]],[3465,["We are our limitations, we cannot tell you lies. So these uh.. advertising thing also"]],[3471,["was impossible for us to do it but they did it for a song, just for a song."]]]);
